`solo-venturing` skill (listed as `solo-venturing:solo-venturing` when it is
installed as a plugin; it holds the phases, the gates and the scripts) and
read `VENTURE.md` (the `Stage:` line), `LOG.md` and `ERRORS.md`. Keep the
files current and end every gate with them written.

